Examples / Beispiele. In the TeX-Shell:

  CD TeX:examples
  pdflatex hello.tex
  pdflatex paper.tex     then: bibtex paper, makeindex paper, pdflatex paper.tex (twice)
  pdflatex tikz.tex
  pdflatex thesis.tex    then: bibtex thesis, pdflatex thesis.tex (twice)
  pdflatex slides.tex
  lualatex unicode.tex
  lualatex languages.tex (needs the four font add-ons TeX-Fonts-*.lha)

The first lualatex run builds the font list and takes a few minutes.
Der erste lualatex-Lauf legt die Schriftenliste an und dauert einige Minuten.
